<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Livestock analysts estimate Tuesday's hog slaughter from 352,000 to 368,000 head versus 362,000 a week ago and 361,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 120,000 to 127,000 head versus 122,000 a week ago and 134,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725</p>
